IncubaCloud relay-oauth image: third-party software
===================================================

This image is docker-mailserver with two additions. The software below keeps
its own licence; the IncubaCloud files (ic-relay-oauth and its configuration)
are under the licence of the repository they come from,
https://github.com/incubacloud/incubacloud (images/relay-oauth/).

docker-mailserver
    https://github.com/docker-mailserver/docker-mailserver
    The base image, unchanged except for the files named in images/relay-oauth/
    Dockerfile. MIT licence; the Debian packages it installs keep theirs
    (/usr/share/doc/*/copyright).

sasl-xoauth2
    https://github.com/tarickb/sasl-xoauth2
    Built from source, unmodified, at the tag and commit written in
    /usr/share/doc/sasl-xoauth2/VERSION. Copyright 2020 Google LLC, Apache
    License 2.0: its notice is /usr/share/doc/sasl-xoauth2/COPYING and the
    licence's full text /usr/share/common-licenses/Apache-2.0.

libjsoncpp26 (Debian package)
    https://github.com/open-source-parsers/jsoncpp
    Installed from Debian for the plugin. MIT licence (or public domain where
    recognised); /usr/share/doc/libjsoncpp26/copyright.
